  "notes": [
    "Maximums and minimums are per 1,000 points unless otherwise stated.",
    "Detached Light Companies: British/KGL Line battalions can lose their Light company to form combined Small/Standard detachment units, addable to any infantry brigade.",
    "Four-Deep Line, Column of Companies and Deep Formation are available special formations — see book for full rules.",
    "Half battery: pay half points (rounded up) to field an artillery battery at half strength; one horse battery per army can be exchanged for a rocket troop.",
    "Allies: up to 50% of points may be spent on Dutch/Belgian, Nassau or Brunswick Brigades.",
    "Named commanders have no official points cost in this supplement — priced here at the generic Divisional Commander cost for their Staff Rating; adjust freely."
  ]
